[messages]
intro        = See link below for credits/thanks
hint_reset   = BTW, If you press R to reset, it won't put you all the way at the beginning.\nThere are checkpoints scattered along the way.
branch       = Just FYI, make sure you restart to the most recent checkpoint before exploring another region.\nOtherwise, you could mess up a puzzle here and get a checkpoint somewhere else, causing it to be permanently messed up.\n(You can ignore this if you did)
uhh          = Uhhhhhhh... Trust me, bud, you don't want to do that. (press Z to undo)
oops         = Oops, puzzle design is hard. How bout we both just pretend we don't see that... (press Z to undo)
bad_idea     = Er... that seems like a bad idea (press Z to undo)
candy_bowl   = >:| (press Z to undo)
secret       = Oh dang, I made a secret but now I have to decide what to put here now. Here have this silly drawing: tinyurl.com/enigmash
warp_thing   = ...don't... (press Z to undo)
left_tunnel  = Left tunnel
right_tunnel = Right tunnel
